      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "....This comment used to say that I ran into the same issue!\nAlas, I did not. \"String-based lookup is inefficient\", Rider said. Little did I know that the alternative breaks material-lookup when building.\nSoooo I've been able to access the material and set its parameters. I'm not 100% sure if that's related to this post though.",
